# Road Rage ({R}, "deals X damage to target creature or planeswalker, where X is 2 plus the number of Mounts and Vehicles you control"):
# Bot2 has a Wall of Stone (0/8) and its own Smuggler's Copter, which never counts for Bot1. Turn 3: Bot1 controls one Mount (Caustic
# Bronco), so the first Road Rage deals 3 to the Wall; the uncrewed Copter is no creature and is refused as a target. Bot1 then casts its own
# Copter. Turn 5: two Mounts and Vehicles, X = 4: the Wall takes 4; and a third Road Rage kills Bot1's own Bronco (a creature of its own is a legal target).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Caustic Bronco
Smuggler's Copter
Road Rage
Road Rage
Road Rage
Mountain
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Wall of Stone
Smuggler's Copter
Island x20

